From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:34:41 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Windows 10 Mobile: periodic diagnostics only with
 --vw-diagnostics

The video statistics (every 10 s, every 300 frames copied or decoded), the
shader cache's and ANGLE's per-shader notes, the vsync statistics and the
ad blocker's counter now go to the log only with --vw-diagnostics among the
engine switches (ANGLE, which has no command line, reads VW_DIAGNOSTICS=1
from the environment). Each line was a write to the phone's flash; a
release build logs what happens once or rarely.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
